            </note>
            <note corresp="#d1032-f2" n="2" xml:id="d1032-f2-content">
                <p>On May 16, 1946, representatives of the United States and India concluded a
                    mutual aid settlement agreement in Washington. For the text, see TIAS No. 1532, or 60 Stat. (pt. 2) 1753.</p>
            </note>
